# Q43 (the author, 2026-09-27): a cell is an argument of any kind -- an atom, a Structure, an array --
# so a table keeps each cell's node (its document stays for the translation, as the impl sources'
# do); l2_tbx_name holds a name only for a cell that is one atom, and 0 for any other.
